WEBVTT

1
00:00:03,910 --> 00:00:04,380
How is it

2
00:00:04,430 --> 00:00:05,590
Let us drink a glass of water first

3
00:00:05,590 --> 00:00:06,590
Mountains and forests are complicated

4
00:00:06,590 --> 00:00:07,550
it's easy to get lost

5
00:00:07,550 --> 00:00:10,390
But we found a passable route heading north

6
00:00:10,390 --> 00:00:11,590
It took about four hours of walking

7
00:00:11,590 --> 00:00:12,670
Finally out of the forest

8
00:00:14,420 --> 00:00:15,660
We marked along the way

9
00:00:15,980 --> 00:00:18,060
Marked the tree trunk with yellow paint

10
00:00:18,220 --> 00:00:19,500
About one every fifty meters

11
00:00:19,500 --> 00:00:20,660
extends to the exit

12
00:00:20,980 --> 00:00:22,420
We made up some more when we came back.

13
00:00:22,700 --> 00:00:23,900
Make sure you can see clearly at night

14
00:00:23,900 --> 00:00:26,260
Can you see any cars on that road?

15
00:00:26,500 --> 00:00:27,980
Or people?

16
00:00:27,980 --> 00:00:29,100
no sign of activity

17
00:00:29,420 --> 00:00:32,860
There are a few abandoned cars but no one is seen, that's fine

18
00:00:34,160 --> 00:00:36,680
Do you still remember what Miss Fang said?

19
00:00:37,240 --> 00:00:41,040
Do you remember what happened when a woman came to ask for help with her baby in her arms?

20
00:00:41,040 --> 00:00:42,040
Miss Fang said

21
00:00:42,040 --> 00:00:43,360
She recalls carefully now

22
00:00:43,640 --> 00:00:47,080
I exploded when I noticed that the woman was holding her child in an awkward way.

23
00:00:47,080 --> 00:00:49,160
The child will definitely cry, so

24
00:00:49,160 --> 00:00:50,160
That could be a dead eagle

25
00:00:50,160 --> 00:00:51,160
That woman is lying

26
00:00:51,160 --> 00:00:52,480
She wasn't coerced at all

27
00:00:52,960 --> 00:00:54,440
She might

28
00:00:54,560 --> 00:00:55,880
He is the instigator of all this

29
00:01:00,830 --> 00:01:02,430
They definitely want our food

30
00:01:02,790 --> 00:01:04,230
If they take the opportunity to break in

31
00:01:06,060 --> 00:01:07,140
Then we are before this

32
00:01:07,140 --> 00:01:11,060
Deal with them first. You mean?
